Ushas is a world very far from [[Geography/Færrin/index|Færrin]] and the home of [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]]. Its people count their years from a founding, or a second founding, and make the present year 72. Few from beyond the [[Phenomena/Firmament|firmament]] have any reason to go there.

Ushas is a [[Phenomena/Crystal Sphere|Crystal Sphere]] on the outer rim of the [[Geography/index|Astra]]. It is significant due to its internal composition of nearly 100% antimatter, making it antithetical to most life (excepting the sphere's native inhabitants).


The [[Phenomena/The Pale|Pale]] spread across the world's prime material over the centuries and consumed its old landmasses. [[People/Dorcan|Dorcan]], one of the founders of [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]], remade new landmasses out of it afterward. Most of Ushas's people live on that new ground now, in a place called [[Geography/Ushas/New Volcantum|New Volcantum]]. Old Volcantum is gone.

Ushas has its own [[Geography/Ushas/Far Realms|Far Realms]], not the Joker World of that name on Færrin's [[Geography/Færrin/Infinite Horizon/Far Realms/index|Infinite Horizon]]. A starship of the [[Org/The Fifth Prosperous Empire of the Sundom|Fifth Sundom]] crashed there; the founders of [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]] found the [[Bestiary/Kaathe|Kaathe]] [[People/Althane/SeRaan|SeRaan]] alive in its wreck, and Sedecium grew out of it.

Ushas's crystal sphere holds sixteen planes, the mark of the first-generation Thessian [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/Harrow|Leitmotif]], which was once there. To cross between them is to cross [[Phenomena/The Pale|the Pale]]. Its gods were three [[Divinity/Higher Kind|Higher Kind]]: Harmony, Ruin and Preservation.

The party that founded [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]] ([[People/Dorcan|Dorcan]], [[People/Zugg|Zugg]], [[People/Rotok|Rotok]] and [[People/Althane/The Broker|T3C]]) began in Waterdeep, delving the [[Geography/Ushas/Undermountain|Undermountain]] beneath it. With their fortune they founded the city of Volcantum, made alliances and trade with other cities, and later fought a war in [[Geography/Ushas/Penthes|Penthes]] against the necromancer [[People/Dahl|Dahl]]. Dahl's last spell unravelled Ushas's weave and damaged the world past repair, filling it with pockets of eldritch monsters around [[Phenomena/Voidheart|Voidhearts]]. Harmony called on the party for aid. They crossed the Pale, found that [[Org/Sacrament|Sacrament]] meant to kill all three gods for [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/Mephistopheles|Mephistopheles]], saw its angel [[People/Samael|Samael]] kill Ruin with a golden needle, and in the end destroyed Sacrament and killed Mephistopheles in the [[Geography/Ushas/Far Realms|Far Realms]]. Dorcan took up the mantle Ruin left and became the new Ruin.
